Yang mana?

528
00:27:09,377 --> 00:27:10,754
Maaf?

529
00:27:12,255 --> 00:27:13,381
Keluargaku Hindu,

530
00:27:13,465 --> 00:27:16,259
kami punya sekitar 33 dewa.

531
00:27:16,885 --> 00:27:17,969
Tuhan kami hanya satu.

532
00:27:19,054 --> 00:27:20,805
Sebagian orang
hanya butuh satu Tuhan.

533
00:27:21,681 --> 00:27:23,016
Baiklah.

534
00:27:25,226 --> 00:27:28,104
Aturan terpenting,
bersikap pintar dan aman.

535
00:27:28,188 --> 00:27:29,397
Aku peringatkan

536
