Centang kalau dia
perlu pemeriksaan lab, rontgen, CT.

568
00:29:14,794 --> 00:29:15,712
Tak butuh semua itu.

569
00:29:15,795 --> 00:29:18,298
- Kapan mulai dipakai?
- Hari ini. Kepala baru.

570
00:29:20,592 --> 00:29:22,260
Kenapa gigimu, Louie?

571
00:29:22,844 --> 00:29:27,265
Gigiku sakit beberapa hari ini,
tetapi nyeri sekali semalam.

572
00:29:28,224 --> 00:29:29,225
Sisi kiri bawah.

573
00:29:30,226 --> 00:29:31,060
Baik.

574
00:29:34,564 --> 00:29:37,484
Ya. Bisa jadi akarnya infeksi.

575
00:29:37,567 --> 00:29:39,569
Kita bisa mengurasnya, tetapi...

576
00:29:41,321 --> 00:29:43,406
Napasmu agak pendek.

577
00:29:44,115 --> 00:29:46,993
Ya, belakangan ini...

578
00:29:47,076 --> 00:29:49,871
sering berjalan-jalan,
berusaha agar bugar.

579
00:29:50,622 --> 00:29:52,707
Namun, kadang aku terengah-engah.

580
00:29:52,791 --> 00:29:55,877
Ya, kau harus melewati toko miras,
bukan masuk ke sana.

581
00:29:55,960 --> 00:29:58,421
Kau harus transplantasi hati
agar sehat.

582
00:29:58,505 --> 00:30:01,549
Aku tak butuh hati baru.
Obati saja sakit gigi ini.

583
00:30:01,633 --> 00:30:02,634
Tarik napas.

584
00:30:06,888 --> 00:30:08,306
Sekali lagi.

585
00:30:08,389 --> 00:30:10,934
- Jantungku masih berdetak?
- Sangat cepat.

586
00:30:11,017 --> 00:30:12,685
Sudah berapa lama kau duduk?

587
00:30:12,769 --> 00:30:15,438
Beberapa menit. Tidak lama.

588
00:30:16,356 --> 00:30:17,357
Louie...

589
